    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Questions\nAnswer from what the teacher showed in Operate.",
      "id": "class_s03_part_a_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "a1",
      "label": "1. After the gateway that follows Goods to ship, how many tokens are there?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "One",
          "value": "one"
        },
        {
          "label": "Two",
          "value": "two"
        },
        {
          "label": "It depends on the conditions",
          "value": "depends"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s03_part_a_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "checklist",
      "key": "a2",
      "label": "2. With post and extra insurance, which two tasks appear at the same time?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "Fill in a post label",
          "value": "label"
        },
        {
          "label": "Take out extra insurance",
          "value": "insurance"
        },
        {
          "label": "Request quotes from carriers",
          "value": "quotes"
        },
        {
          "label": "Package goods",
          "value": "package"
        },
        {
          "label": "Add paperwork and move package to pick area",
          "value": "pick"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s03_part_a_5"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "a2b",
      "label": "3. The gateway after those two tasks (an inclusive join) waits for...",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "the branches this instance started",
          "value": "started"
        },
        {
          "label": "all its incoming branches, always",
          "value": "all"
        },
        {
          "label": "the first branch that arrives",
          "value": "first"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s03_part_a_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "a3",
      "label": "4. Why is the merge of the two delivery modes an exclusive gateway and not a parallel one?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "Only one of the two branches runs; a parallel join would wait forever for the other",
          "value": "onlyOne"
        },
        {
          "label": "An exclusive merge is faster",
          "value": "faster"
        },
        {
          "label": "There is no difference: both pass the token on",
          "value": "same"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s03_part_a_7"
    }
  ],
